## Writing

No em dash, no semicolon, no emoji anywhere, including commit messages.
No generated-by or co-authored-by line on commits.
Comments say why, not what.

## Working agreements

Never report a test result that did not come from a run made after the last file was written.
Never open a pull request unasked. Never merge.
When something cannot be checked, say UNKNOWN rather than filling the gap.
